'''Michelia '''is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] increases health, attack, and [[Freeze|freeze]] chance, and also increases time between attacks and backswing. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

